  <text xml:lang="la">
    <front>
      <div xml:id="starts-on">
        <pb ed="#P" n="1270C"/>
      </div>
    </front>
    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-is27">
        <head xml:id="gom-is27-Hd1e98">Caput 27</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-is27-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-is27-Hd1e102">Versus 2</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is27-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is27-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is27_2@1-3">In die illa,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-is27-Rd1e109"><name xml:id="gom-is27-Nd1e110" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is27-Qd1e113"><seg type="qs">Tradunt Hebraei diabolum</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">ut inducatur gladius super eum.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is27-Dd1e122">
          <head xml:id="gom-is27-Hd1e124">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is27-d1e126">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is27-Qd1e128" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is27_1@17-17">Vectem.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is27-Rd1e131"><name xml:id="gom-is27-Nd1e132" ref="#Jerome">HIER.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is27-Qd1e135"><seg type="qs">LXX: Fugitivum. Tunc enim fugiet</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">serpens autem, quia insidias molliter infundit.</seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is27-d1e143">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is27-Qd1e145" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is27_1@25-25">Cetum.</quote>
            Hebraei, <quote xml:id="gom-is27-Qd1e148">Tanniu;</quote> unde Hebraei fabulabantur Leviathan habitare sub terra et in aethere, Tanniu vero in mari.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is27-Dd1e152">
          <head xml:id="gom-is27-Hd1e154">Versus 2</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is27-d1e156">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is27-Qd1e158" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is27_2@4-6">Vinea meri cantabit.</quote>
            Cui Jeremias propinat calicem meracissimum. Merum Graece, purum Latine.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is27-Dd1e163">
          <head xml:id="gom-is27-Hd1e165">Versus 5</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is27-d1e167">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1270D"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is27-Qd1e171" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is27_5@1-2">An potius?</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is27-Qd1e174"><seg type="qs">Vox Patris deliberative</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">qui non sunt salvati auctoritate legis.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is27-Dd1e184">
          <head xml:id="gom-is27-Hd1e186">Versus 6</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is27-d1e188">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is27-Qd1e190" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is27_6@9-9">Israel,</quote>
            id est populus Judaeorum conversus, videns doctrina filiorum suorum orbem floruisse.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is27-Dd1e195">
          <head xml:id="gom-is27-Hd1e197">Versus 9</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is27-d1e199">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is27-Qd1e201" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is27_9@1-1">Idcirco.</quote>
            Quasi diceret: <quote xml:id="gom-is27-Qd1e204" source="http://scta.info/resource/is27_9@4-7">Ideo dimittetur iniquitas domui Jacob:</quote> et caetera propter merita scilicet apostolorum, qui per mundum idolorum altaria comminuerunt.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is27-Dd1e209">
          <head xml:id="gom-is27-Hd1e211">Versus 11</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is27-d1e213">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is27-Qd1e215" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is27_11@5-5">Conterentur.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is27-Rd1e218"><name xml:id="gom-is27-Nd1e219" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is27-Qd1e222">Sicut Delbora ad bellum ivit et populum ad ignominiam Judaeorum judicavit; et imminente Chaldaeorum captivitate, viris tacentibus Olda prophetavit: sic imminente captivitate Romanorum, veniebant forte mulieres et docebant eos.</quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is27-d1e225">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1271A"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is27-Qd1e229" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is27_11@6-6">Mulieres.</quote>
            Diversae Synagogae; vel aperte mulieres, quae nudatis pectoribus sanguinantes feriunt lacertos.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is27-d1e233">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is27-Qd1e235" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is27_11@9-10">Docentes eam.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is27-Rd1e238"><name xml:id="gom-is27-Nd1e239" ref="#Jerome">HIER.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is27-Qd1e242">Magna infelicitas populi et reprehensio, a mulieribus lamentationis carmina discere.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is27-Dd1e246">
          <head xml:id="gom-is27-Hd1e248">Versus 12</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is27-d1e250">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is27-Qd1e252" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is27_12@8-9">Ab alveo.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is27-Qd1e255"><seg type="qs">LXX: ab Euphrate</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">quia habet turbidas aquas, et non perpetuas.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
